              "text": "el volante — \"the steering wheel\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Pon las dos manos en el volante. Put both hands on the wheel."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Estar al volante — to be at the wheel, to be driving."
            }
          ]
        },
