              "text": "el maletero — \"the boot (of a car), the trunk\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Las maletas van en el maletero. The suitcases go in the boot."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Spain says el maletero; Mexico la cajuela; much of South America el baúl."
            }
          ]
        },
