          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "maletero is built on maleta \"suitcase\". Maleta is usually traced to French mallette, a little malle \"trunk\", which goes back to a Frankish word for a bag."
            }
          ]
        },
